Package: hmdm-build
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, aapt, mariadb-client | default-mysql-client, wget
Description: Headwind MDM build for Medulla
 This package ships the compiled Headwind MDM web panel (launcher.war) and
 its installer in /opt/HMDM_BUILD. It does not configure anything by itself:
 run hmdm_install.sh from /opt/HMDM_BUILD to deploy Headwind MDM.
